              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वर्गात एकूण तीस मुलं आहेत. vargāt ekūṇ tīs mulaṁ āhet. There are thirty children in the class in all."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also an adjective: एकूण (ekūṇ) खर्च, the total cost."
            }
          ]
        },
